  "geometry_notes": [
   "Stems are trapezoids of width A at the soffit and C at the flange underside, centred E apart. The drawn stem-to-flange fillets are undimensioned and omitted; published areas close exactly without them. Light (L) and heavy (H) tables are separate profiles even where W and H coincide.",
   "Pinned source discrepancies (not fitted): the five light sections and H5-36 close to <=0.07 % area; the nine other heavy sections are 2.5-7.5 in2 (0.3-0.9 %) below the published areas with Ixx up to +1.7 % (H8-27) and yb up to -0.63 %. No single undimensioned detail (fillet, chamfer) explains all nine, so the table geometry is kept as printed and the residuals are pinned per size in the tests. L5-27 yb -0.35 % and L6-27 Ixx +0.14 % are also pinned."
